      "message": "Yes, I didn\u0027t see noticeable changes(other than in variance) average time for MicrodroidBenchmarks is nearly the same(same run with no changes can have+-10% change). \n\nThe initial design was less abstract than that, where ops provided functions as write_l2_entry, which where looped on hundred of times, Benchmarking this showed regressions specially in virtio tests. That is why ops now are very abstract to provide minimum indirection.",
